### 7. 核心源码走读片段

#### 片段 1：IBus 服务端代理层防御性判空与转发（`src/ibus/live_broadcast_ibus_impl.cc`）
```cpp
InsErrorCode LiveBroadcastLiveBroadcastServer::LiveBroadcastStart() {
  auto manager = LiveBroadcastService::GetInstance().GetManager();
  if (!manager) {
    ILOGS_E << "LiveBroadcastStart failed: manager is nullptr";
    return InsErrorCode::kErrNodev; // 节点未初始化保护
  }
  // 转发给中枢管理器，纯代理无锁流转
  return manager->RequestStart();
}
```

#### 片段 2：RPC 契约异步化与线程间同步请求（`src/manager/live_broadcast_manager.cc`）
```cpp
InsErrorCode LiveBroadcastManager::RequestStart() {
  // 向状态机专有工作线程投递同步判定指令，等待受理结果
  auto result = work_msg_looper_->PostAndWaitResponse<InsErrorCode>(
      MessageIds::kDispatchStart, 0);
  if (!result.has_value()) {
    ILOGS_E << "PostAndWaitResponse kDispatchStart timeout or failed";
    return InsErrorCode::kErrTimeout;
  }
  return result.value();
}
```

#### 片段 3：系统主题订阅者分发网络断开通知（`src/ibus/netd_subscriber.cc`）
```cpp
void NetdSubscriber::OnWifiStatusChanged(const WifiStatusPayload& payload) {
  if (payload.status == WifiState::kDisconnected) {
    ILOGS_W << "Received WiFi disconnected from netd topic";
    if (auto manager = LiveBroadcastService::GetInstance().GetManager()) {
      // 投递网络断开事件给工作线程
      manager_->PostNetworkDisconnected();
    }
  }
}
```

#### 片段 4：共享内存单写多读原子刷新（`src/manager/live_broadcast_manager.cc`）
```cpp
void LiveBroadcastManager::UpdateShareState(LiveBroadcastState state, uint32_t duration_sec) {
  if (!share_state_ptr_) return;
  
  // release 内存序确保数据完全写毕后状态生效
  share_state_ptr_->duration_sec.store(duration_sec, std::memory_order_relaxed);
  share_state_ptr_->current_state.store(static_cast<uint32_t>(state), std::memory_order_release);
  share_state_ptr_->update_ts_ms.store(GetSteadyTimeMs(), std::memory_order_relaxed);
}
```

